CM_ BU_ Cooling "The cooling board is a board that receives temperatures through sensors and CAN bus and modulates the fans and pumps accordingly.";
CM_ BU_ DasFront "Front Das is a board that receives data from multiple sources and sends it resampled to the main network.";
CM_ BU_ DasRear "Rear Das is a board that receives data from multiple sources and sends it resampled to the main network.";
CM_ BU_ Ecu "Ecu of the vehicle, talks to inverters and keeps car state.";
CM_ BU_ Imu "Inertial Measurement Unit, reads acceleration and angular velocity from the IMU sensor and provides it to other nodes.";
CM_ BU_ Lvac "Low Voltage Battery Management System (LVBMS) is a device that monitors and manages the low voltage battery system. It provides information about the battery status, voltage, current, and other parameters.";
CM_ BU_ Pedals "Pedals handle throttle and brake inputs, as well as BOTS and brake pressures.";
CM_ BU_ Pipo "Power-in Power-out (PIPO) is a device that controls the power supply to various components in the system. It monitors all the low voltage rails.";
CM_ BU_ Raspberry "Reads and writes";
CM_ BU_ Steering "Steering board control the steering actuator and reads the steering encoder.";
CM_ BU_ SteeringWheel "This node represents the steering wheel, which controls parameters in the car via its inputs and displays values in the screen.";
CM_ BU_ TsacMainboard "High Voltage Battery Management System (HVBMS) is a device that monitors and manages the high voltage battery system. It provides information about the battery status, voltage, current, and other parameters.";
CM_ SG_ 1968 voltage "Tensione sul canale dell'estensimetro (uscita amplificatore), da adc_filtered: 3290 mV * media / 65536";
CM_ SG_ 1968 adc_raw "Ultimo campione dell'LTC1865 (canale SE_CH2), non filtrato; campionamento a 1.5 kHz da timer, frame a ACQUISINATORE_ADC_SEND_RATE";
CM_ SG_ 1968 adc_filtered "Campioni a 1.5 kHz filtrati dal firmware (ACQUISINATORE_ADC_FILTER: media su 20 ms, oppure notch 50/100/150 Hz + passa basso a SEND_RATE/4), arrotondati; voltage ha il valore non arrotondato";
CM_ SG_ 1952 lockin_out "Componente in fase all'uscita dell'amplificatore, ampiezza di picco con segno";
CM_ SG_ 1952 adc_raw "Media dell'uscita dell'amplificatore sulla finestra";
CM_ SG_ 1953 flags "bit0 saturazione bassa, bit1 saturazione alta, bit2 errore SPI, bit3 non calibrato, bit4 nessuna misura (resistance = NaN)";
